    "text": "On vre Drichtines name, ic \u00feurstan Wine sune kithe alle manne ihu ic an \u00fee \u00feing \u00fee me God haue\u00f0 lent\n\u00deat is \u00feat ic an \u00feat lond at Wimbisc into Cristes kirke for mine soule & for Lefwares and for Egelsithes\nAnd ic an \u00feat lond at Herlawe into sancte Eadmunde buten \u00fee halue hide \u00fee Alfwine hauede at\nAnd ic an \u00feat lond at Sculham at \u00fee Northhalle into seynt Eadmunde after vnker bothre day and \u00feo men\nAnd ic an \u00feat lond at Wetheringsete into Ely buten \u00feat lond \u00feat Aylri haue\u00f0.\nHabbe he \u00feat fre his day and his wiues and after here bothere day into \u00fee tunkirke & \u00feo men fre.\nAnd Ic an \u00feat lond at Cnapwelle into Ely buten \u00feat lond \u00feat Ordeh haue\u00f0 & Aylric munek haue\u00f0 and \u00feo\nAnd ic an \u00feat lond at Sculham at \u00fee Middelhalle half into sancte Benedicte to Rameseye & half into\nAnd ic an mine kinelouerd for mine hergete to marc goldes and to hors and sadelfate and helm and\nAnd ic wille \u00feat men selle \u00feat lond at Bidicheseye and nime of \u00feat lond to marc goldes to \u00fee kinges\nAnd \u00feat \u00fee \u00feer ouer go\u00f0 delen le eruene men for his soule on his felawes witnesse buten \u00feat vttreste\nAnd wille \u00feat min and Vlfkeles felageschipe stonde to \u00feat forwarde \u00fee wit speken habben, \u00feat is \u00feat\nAnd ic an mine wife Ailgi\u00f0e al \u00fee \u00feing \u00fee ic haue on Norfolke so ic it her hire gaf to mund and to\nAnd ic an Agilgi\u00f0 \u00feat lond at Henham buten an half hide \u00feat schal into \u00fee kirke.\nAnd ic an Alfwi prest and \u00feurstan mine hirdprest and Ordeh mine hirdprest \u00feat he habben \u00feat lond at\nAnd ic an Meruyn and his wife and here bern \u00feat lond at Dunmawe butan an alf hide \u00feat schal into \u00fee\n& ic an mine cnihtes \u00feat wude at Aungre buten \u00feat derhage & \u00feat stod \u00fee ic \u00feer habbe.\n\u00deis is to witnesse innon Norfolke, Harold erl and Stigand Bisscop and Osgote Clape and Godwine &\nAnd innon Suffolke, Lefstan decan and al se hird on seynt Eadmundes biri & Eadric and Alfric &\nAnd in Grauntebreggeschire, Leswi abbot & al se hird bynnen Ely and Aelfwine Abbot & al se hird\nAnd innen Essexe, Alfger \u00fee Erles sune and Lefkild & Osulf File and Wlwine and Sendi and Leuerich\nSe \u00fee \u00feis quide awenden wille buten ic self it be God him fordo nu and on domisday.\n\u00deise write sinden \u00fere, on schal into seynt Eadmunde and on into Ely and on schal ben innon min owen\nAnd \u00feat lond at Henham \u00feurstan and Agelgi\u00f0 and Askil vnnen Aegelswide after here aldreday.\nAnd after hire day go \u00feat lond into sancte Aetheldrith for hire owen soule and for \u00feurstanes and for\nAnd ic an \u00feurgot mine cnihte half hide \u00fee Aelstan on sit at Aungre & Meruin half hide and \u00feane litle\nAnd \u00feat ouer beth ofgon he it on vnker gemede gif wit aleten willen.",
